			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 60280301,
					"content": "如何，伤口还痛吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280302,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280303
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60280303,
					"content": "我找人准备了些可能会用到的药品，需要就吃吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280304,
						60280305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奈芙尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280304,
					"content": "谢谢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280306
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60280306,
					"content": "那，我把事件发生后，和艾莉丝女士的通话内容复述一下。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "杜林"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280307,
					"content": "多托雷那个家伙，为了吸引「魔女会」的注意，在提瓦特的边界做了大文章。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "艾莉丝"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280308,
					"content": "我一直以为是来自世界外的深渊力量在干扰提瓦特，这是相当常见的情况。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "艾莉丝"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280309,
					"content": "但是在杜林你们成功干涉了挪德卡莱的虚影之后，我意识到这种干扰也有可能来自提瓦特内部。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "艾莉丝"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280310,
					"content": "可是，我们并没有改变虚影的命运啊…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280311
					],
					"speakerTitle": "杜林"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280311,
					"content": "对，你们没有影响那个虚影的结局，但是某种「变数」被堆砌到了你的身上。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280312
					],
					"speakerTitle": "艾莉丝"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280312,
					"content": "「变数」？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280313,
					"content": "嗯，比如你们听到了本来无从得知的消息，或是产生了原本不会萌发的想法，这都算是「变数」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "艾莉丝"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280314,
					"content": "当然这种事在几乎无穷无尽的可能性面前，并不算什么，可是当它被刻意堆砌，概念就不一样了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280315
					],
					"speakerTitle": "艾莉丝"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280315,
					"content": "而这一切「变数」，便是让多托雷能够在这一晚，在你们开启传送门的时候，达成自己阴谋的必要条件。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280316
					],
					"speakerTitle": "艾莉丝"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280316,
					"content": "不过，具体多托雷做了什么，我们还无从得知。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280317
					],
					"speakerTitle": "尼可"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280317,
					"content": "嗯，还要搞清楚哥伦比娅的现状如何。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280318
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法尔伽"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280318,
					"content": "大概就是这样。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280319
					],
					"speakerTitle": "杜林"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280319,
					"content": "和我想的一样，多托雷完全消失了。但至少他并没有如愿控制哥伦比娅。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280320
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「仆人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280320,
					"content": "但现状可能比那更糟…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280321
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60280321,
					"content": "唔…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280322,
						60280323
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280322,
					"content": "她为了破坏「博士」的计划…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280324
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60280324,
					"content": "欸，是这样吗？！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280325
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280325,
					"content": "你们没看到吗？她跳了进去…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280326
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60280326,
					"content": "我们只看到「博士」出现，使用了某种力量，接着他和哥伦比娅就都消失了，你也从空中掉进了海里。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280327
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280327,
					"content": "（原来如此，「博士」锁定了时间，只有我可以自由行动。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280328
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60280328,
					"content": "（在他们眼里，那场战斗和哥伦比娅的决断都只是一瞬间的事。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280329
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60280329,
					"content": "（这就是「三月」的权能吗…我没受到影响…是因为我是「降临者」？）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280330
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60280330,
					"content": "所以，哥伦比娅主动开启了「月之门」，落入了雷利尔和索琳蒂丝曾踏入的神秘空间…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280331
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奈芙尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280331,
					"content": "凶多吉少啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280332
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法尔伽"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280332,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280333,
						60280334
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「仆人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280333,
					"content": "所以多托雷一直躲着我们…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280335
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60280335,
					"content": "这么看来，「三月现世」、还有猎月人的出现…恐怕背后都有多托雷在操纵。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280336
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280336,
					"content": "按照艾莉丝女士的说法，他想做的事，就是超越自己的命运，完成只有神才能完成的实验。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280337
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280337,
					"content": "…真是个疯狂的家伙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280338
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「仆人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280338,
					"content": "对了，阿帽呢，他怎么不在这里？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280339
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280339,
					"content": "在和艾莉丝女士通讯之后，他说有些眉目，就拿走了嘟嘟通讯仪，独自去调查了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280340
					],
					"speakerTitle": "杜林"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280340,
					"content": "临走的时候他的表情变得很可怕，我从来没见过他那副样子…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280341
					],
					"speakerTitle": "杜林"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280341,
					"content": "（应该是愤怒和不甘心吧，明明已经在提防多托雷了，还是被他抢先了一步。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280342
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60280342,
					"content": "（这么说的话，我又何尝不是这样…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280343
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60280343,
					"content": "我回来了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280344
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280344,
					"content": "阿帽！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280345
					],
					"speakerTitle": "杜林"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280345,
					"content": "我又去找了那些「亥珀波瑞亚」的虚影，总算是搞清楚了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280346
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280346,
					"content": "我让他们和通讯仪另一边的尼可细细对质，发现他们描述的历史和尼可的记忆果然是不同的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280347
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280347,
					"content": "为什么会这样？尼可应该不会出错才对。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280348
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280348,
					"content": "因为被骗的是那些虚影。他们的历史里出现了一个根本就不该存在的救世主。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280349
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280349,
					"content": "这个救世主许诺他们能够在虚假之天内创造一个新的月亮，还能把他们的月神带回来。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280350
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280350,
					"content": "这些人愚蠢地相信了他，将他所需要的关于月亮的知识全部告诉了他。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280351
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280351,
					"content": "一听就知道，这是多托雷在搞鬼。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280352
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280352,
					"content": "在亥珀波瑞亚的遗迹中，听虚影聊起历史，尼可会说里面有些错误…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280353
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280353,
					"content": "可多托雷应该没办法进入那扇门啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280354
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280354,
					"content": "他没进去过。尼可说，这是同时代的虚影因果联系被干扰后引发的异样状况。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280355
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280355,
					"content": "而多托雷所堆砌的「变数」，甚至大到能够对不曾见过的虚影造成影响。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280356
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280356,
					"content": "原来不是记忆不清，而是被篡改了啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280357
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奈芙尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280357,
					"content": "这就是多托雷想方设法堆砌的可能性，他将变数化为知识，都堆砌在了自己的身上。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280358
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280358,
					"content": "「祈月之夜」的夜晚…他用这些知识，真的创造了一轮「伪月」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280359
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280359,
					"content": "这怎么可能做到？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280360
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280360,
					"content": "准确来说，是让术法的感知出现了偏差——",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280361
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280361,
					"content": "术法通过月矩力感受月亮的位置，只要「伪月」比天外的霜月更像月亮…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280362
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280362,
					"content": "那扇门就会把哥伦比娅送到「伪月」的位置，也就是多托雷身边！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280363
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280363,
					"content": "在多托雷控制了哥伦比娅之后，传送术法依然维持着，他又操纵她的力量，夺走了两块月髓。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280364
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280364,
					"content": "那个时候，月髓从我们眼前突然消失…离开遗迹的时候，为时已晚。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280365
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280365,
					"content": "那时候，多托雷已经集齐了三月的力量。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280366
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「仆人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280366,
					"content": "现在要…如何是好…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280367
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280367,
					"content": "我想知道女皇陛下的想法，之前和她提及的担心果然发生了。但我们也不能一味等待女皇陛下的决断…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280368
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「仆人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280368,
					"content": "将我们视作朋友的，并非愚人众执行官「少女」，而是哥伦比娅·希珀塞莱尼娅。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280369
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「仆人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280369,
					"content": "在此严峻情形下，如果女皇陛下仍然执意禁止执行官之间的兵刃相向…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280370
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「仆人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280370,
					"content": "那我也将遵从内心的选择，以「佩露薇利」的身份出战。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280371
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「仆人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280371,
					"content": "阿蕾奇诺…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280372
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280372,
					"content": "时间紧迫，我先走一步。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280373
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「仆人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280373,
					"content": "就连阿蕾奇诺好像也变得不太冷静了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280374
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280374,
					"content": "（可能她觉得这件事有她的责任，而我也是同样…可恶。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280375
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60280375,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280376
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280376,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280377
					],
					"speakerTitle": "杜林"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280377,
					"content": "来来来，大家不要都丧着脸，听我说两句。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280378
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法尔伽"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280378,
					"content": "情况很糟，非常糟。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280379
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法尔伽"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280379,
					"content": "多托雷采取了每位骑士都会唾弃的方式，侥幸获得了一时之利。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280380
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法尔伽"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280380,
					"content": "连魔女都说他用「变数」影响了命运，哈哈，但我看未必。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280381
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法尔伽"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280381,
					"content": "我听过很多人告诉我，提瓦特的命运既定，事实好像真的如此。那多托雷凭什么能让自己成为例外呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280382
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法尔伽"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280382,
					"content": "既然多托雷可以堆砌「变数」，我们怎么不行？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280383
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法尔伽"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280383,
					"content": "而且，你就更不应该沮丧了，远道而来的旅人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280384
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法尔伽"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280384,
					"content": "一切都还没结束呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280385,
						60280386
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法尔伽"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280385,
					"content": "嗯。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280387
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60280387,
					"content": "你不是一个人。这里的所有人，说话的，不说话的，全都在自责。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280388
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法尔伽"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280388,
					"content": "但我们没一个人是会躺在安乐椅上晒太阳的家伙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280389
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法尔伽"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280389,
					"content": "即便被击倒，也会很快站起来，这才是骑士之道！不要忘了，荣誉骑士你可是我们蒙德的正统骑士！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280390
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法尔伽"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280390,
					"content": "嗯…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280391
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 60280391,
					"content": "法尔伽说得对，还没结束呢！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280392
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280392,
					"content": "至少多托雷这个家伙，我们要痛揍他一顿，新账旧账一起算！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280393
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280393,
					"content": "这才像话。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280394
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法尔伽"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280394,
					"content": "其他人呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280395
					],
					"speakerTitle": "法尔伽"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280395,
					"content": "我会借助月矩力，调查哥伦比娅的下落，我也不愿意就此放弃。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280396
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菈乌玛"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280396,
					"content": "发生在挪德卡莱的事情，「秘闻馆」想知道就一定能知道。情报这边我来提供。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280397
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奈芙尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280397,
					"content": "「叮铃哐啷蛋卷工坊」也会提供全力支持，我和爱诺计划逆向研究多托雷的本次行动，寻找突破口。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280398
					],
					"speakerTitle": "伊涅芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280398,
					"content": "虽然艾莉丝女士和尼可女士要解决提瓦特边界的突发灾害，暂时回不来…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280399
					],
					"speakerTitle": "杜林"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280399,
					"content": "但她们都很生气，要求我和阿贝多作为「魔女会」的代理人不留余力地抗击多托雷。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280401
					],
					"speakerTitle": "杜林"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280401,
					"content": "准备好了？前期也有许多研究工作要做。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280402,
					"content": "我会尽力的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						60280403
					],
					"speakerTitle": "杜林"
				},
				{
					"id": 60280403,
